        "cooked": "<p>So, we are only a few days away from Vengence! So excited(wish i had the money for it though). I was wondering if we could get some previews for Vengence since we are so close to Oct 13th. A hero card and one or two of thier cards would make my month!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I understand if &gt;G says no, but I understnad were they are comming from.</p>",
