        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-10T21:50:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I thought it was always slated for early 2014.&nbsp; The preorders were this fall, but I thought it was confirmed some time ago that it wouldn't get back from the printers until like March of next year.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Kingofsouls\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/58f4c7/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Kingofsouls:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>EDIT: someone please deleat this topic please.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Why?&nbsp; Since the other topic about Vengeance was locked, we might as well talk about its (eventual) approach here.</p>",
