        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Envisioner\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Envisioner:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Kingofsouls wrote:</b><br><blockquote>EDIT: someone please deleat this topic please.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nWhy?&nbsp; Since the other topic about Vengeance was locked, we might as well talk about its (eventual) approach here.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Because it doesn't make any sense that this would be in the rules and gameplay forum instead of one of the more appropriate ones.</p>",
