        "raw": "[quote=\"Envisioner\"]\n\n&nbsp;\n<div class=\"bb-quote\"><b>Kingofsouls wrote:</b><br /><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">EDIT: someone please deleat this topic please.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nWhy?&nbsp; Since the other topic about Vengeance was locked, we might as well talk about its (eventual) approach here.\n\n[/quote]\n\nBecause it doesn&#39;t make any sense that this would be in the rules and gameplay forum instead of one of the more appropriate ones.\n",
