      {
        "id": 76809,
        "name": "Paul",
        "username": "Paul",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-10T22:58:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<blockquote><p><span>Because it doesn't make any sense that this would be in the rules and gameplay forum instead of one of the more appropriate ones.</span></p></blockquote><p><span>Well, that is easy to fix! :)</span></p><p>Originally, when we ran the Shattered Timelines and Galactic Strike Force Kickstarter campaigns with Vengeance as an add-on, we expected that we'd be releasing it this month. Unfortunately, we later had to delay it by several months in order to optimize the quality of the game. We are definitely on track to get it out to Kickstarter backers in February at this point.</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:57:30.169Z",
