        "created_at": "2013-10-11T00:26:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think some people won't be affected by this too much anyway (most likely those of us outside the USA), because of having combined Vengeance with GSF in terms of shipping. So whenever Vengeance comes out, if it's before GSF I'm gonna have to wait a while longer anyway since I'm getting them&nbsp; both at once.</p>\n<p>But what a hell of a package <span class=\"bbcode-i\">that's</span> gonna be when it arrives :D.</p>",
